Description: Abseil throw_delegate library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: 20250127
Requires: absl_config = 20250127, absl_raw_logging_internal = 20250127
Libs: -L${libdir}  -labsl_throw_delegate 
Cflags: -I${includedir} -DNOMINMAX
